                                "sense_id": "9ee0e7cd-6db4-3969-bf05-edb389322519",
                                "text": "His perceived inexpressiveness particularly impressed the critics in France, where the perceptive Louis Delluc wrote about him in almost Bressonian terms:"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "87cde23c-d48a-4255-8c30-677506d8e06f",
